# Chocobilious (windurst 27) against In a Stew (a container, group 10) at Kuoh Rhel and Matata. Chocobilious completed
# by a GM at fame level 2 with no needToZone, so his script has nothing to play for Kuoh Rhel here: In a Stew's 235
# (Progress) answers him, then (begun at 235's finish) its 236 (Event) on every talk, and Matata its 237 (Chocobilious'
# 226 only on his script's turn after it). The needToZone interplay (232 on the script's turn) is in in_a_stew#compete.
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=129.5,-5.0,-104.0 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 50
login
quest Windurst.Chocobilious completed
trigger Kuoh_Rhel                       # In a Stew's 235 (Chocobilious completed, level 2), not his script's 232
finish                                  # begun, Prog 1
trigger Kuoh_Rhel                       # In a Stew's 236
finish
trigger Kuoh_Rhel                       # 236 again (his script's turn: no needToZone, nothing of his)
finish
trigger Kuoh_Rhel                       # 236
finish
trigger Matata                          # In a Stew's 237
finish
trigger Matata                          # his script's turn: Chocobilious completed: 226
finish
